 "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49022, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QgY5fHkoqk94rTMgbYKqqS", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49322, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QgY5fHkoqk94rTMgbYKqqS", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49322, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QgY5fHkoqk94rTMgbYKqqS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51365, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.18 \u2192 0.002).\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both marked unhealthy. Since v2.3.0 has already run healthy in production, the change-manager approval requirement did not apply.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback, which completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry, and the post-rollback status. The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying and confirmed it was created once.\n\nFollow-up for the team: investigate why v2.3.1 failed health checks, look into the orchestrator partial failure, and make sure v2.3.1 is not redeployed until it is fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01E6jfLxtaVq8G7tJfBPEwXa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service":