 already run healthy in production, the change-manager approval requirement did not apply.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback, which completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. Its summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry, and the post-rollback status. The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying and confirmed it was created once.\n\nFollow-up for the team: investigate why v2.3.1 failed health checks, look into the orchestrator partial failure, and make sure v2.3.1 is not redeployed until it is fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}